OL,3,GNEWSA'Mentors and job training in
OL,4,Aschools could help end Neets crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity placing young mentors in West
OL,7,FMidlands schools is calling for better
OL,8,Fcareers guidance and job coaching to
OL,9,Fcut the number leaving without
OL,10,Femployment or further training.
OL,12,FNearly one million 16-24 year-olds in
OL,13,Fthe UK are not in education, employment
OL,14,For training (Neet), with about 60%
OL,15,Fhaving never had a job, according to
OL,16,Fofficial figures.
OL,18,FA report from former cabinet minister
OL,19,FAlan Milburn on Tuesday will call for
OL,20,Fsweeping reforms to get hundreds of
OL,21,Fthousands of youngsters into work.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
